    "id": "01a1d168-39ac-70bb-8eee-3ac18cc44d22",
    "name": "SPARK Lead",
    "description": "SPARK Lead is a virtual event series designed to support growing companies in the greater Ann Arbor region by offering insights and strategies on effective leadership, team development, and workplace culture.\n\nWhether you’re an executive, HR professional, team leader, or someone who champions positive change, SPARK Lead provides practical tools to help you build strong, collaborative teams where everyone can contribute and succeed.\n\nEach session focuses on a specific leadership topic and features an interactive format that encourages meaningful participation and peer connection.\n\nThe series is free to attend, but registration is required. You’re welcome to join as many sessions as you like—there’s no need to commit to the full series. Due to the interactive nature of these events, attendance is limited and recordings will not be made available.",
    "summary": "SPARK Lead is a virtual event series designed to support growing companies in the greater Ann Arbor region by offering insights and strategies on effective leadership, team development, and workplace culture.",
