    "id": "01a1d168-3333-7561-833c-df2e5fc3caac",
    "name": "Women in Tech Meetup – Traverse City",
    "description": "Join us for connection, empowerment, and lots of fun!\n\nEach month Women in Tech gathers to build community and support amongst women working in, or interested in, the tech industry and tech-related roles.\n\nThis meetup is casual, fun, and easy to drop into. We talk about what we’re currently working on, share our stories, and pool our collected expertise to support each other on our journeys.\n\nThis informal meetup is meant to help women build local connections and work on their professional growth (yeah, support systems!). Gatherings are often made up of half-returning and half-new attendees, creating a welcoming and approachable energy.\n\nThis event is free and open to all, including students! Light snacks will be provided. Registration is requested to ensure ample seating, but walk-ins are always welcome. Look for the Women in Tech/20Fathoms signage.\n\nWe can’t wait to see you!\n\nAbout 20Fathoms\n\nBased in Traverse City, 20Fathoms is a nonprofit organization and the hub for entrepreneurship and innovation in Northwest Michigan. The 20Fathoms team works with entrepreneurs and offers specialized services to meet the unique needs of scaling startups. Programs include startup coaching & education, access to capital, a vibrant coworking space, resources and support. For more information visit 20fathoms.org\n\nThank you to our event partner:",
