    "id": "01a1d168-334b-7523-acd2-552a070b1777",
    "name": "Startup Coaching: Virtual",
    "description": "Happens every Thursday by appointment. Just show up and bring your questions!\n\nConnect with startup experts who can help you grow.\n\nStartup coaches share their time, wisdom, and connections to help entrepreneurs build successful businesses and avoid common mistakes. They can provide guidance to entrepreneurs with new and growing businesses on a full range of topics including business planning and entity formation, funding strategy, sales, operations, human resources, and much more.\n\nNew business owners routinely state that mentorship and connections are very important. However, entrepreneurs must be open and committed to learning, as well as willing to make the time to meet with their coach. To better serve our regional entrepreneurs, 20Fathoms now offers access to coaching virtually!\n\nVirtual coaching is open to all by appointment. Schedule an appointment.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\nFor your small business, startup, or idea\n\nA private, one-on-one meeting with a startup expert\n\nTroubleshoot your business goals and challenges\n\nHonest, supportive feedback\n\nRecommendations on resources and tools",
