    "name": "Entrepreneurship 101",
    "description": "Do you want to start your own business but are not sure where to start? Interested in a small side-hustle or starting the next leading company in an industry? Entrepreneurship 101 is here to help you begin that journey. This discussion-based workshop will provide key questions for you to explore that will help you build a robust business plan. Questions discussed in this workshop will cover seven key building blocks of your business:\n\nVision, Mission , and Values\n\nMarketing Analysis\n\nProducts & Services\n\nMarketing Strategy\n\nOperations\n\nFinancial Empowerment\n\nBusiness Finance",
